<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέγγῠος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under surety</i>:
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of persons,
				<i>having given surety, liable to be called to account</i> or
				<i>punished,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				38
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. πλὴν θανάτου</span>
			<i>liable to any punishment</i> short of death, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.71
			</span></i>: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γὸ γὰρ ὑπέγγυον δίκᾳ
				καὶ θεοῖσιν</span>
			<i>liability</i> to human and divine justice, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				1027
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			things, <i>legitimate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμος ὑ.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέγγυος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pledged, hypothecated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1792.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				507.31
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
